  "title": "Pamnest Twin Halloween Comforter Set with Sheets, 5 Pieces - Design 02",
  "handle": "pamnest-twin-halloween-comforter-set-with-sheets-5-pieces-design-02",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a cozy and stylish retreat with this Halloween Comforter Set. Designed for year-round comfort, this set offers a perfect blend of softness and breathability, ensuring a peaceful night's sleep.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Filled with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This 5-piece set comes with one comforter, one flat sheet, one fitted sheet, one pillowcase, and one pillow sham.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish and exquisite patterns that add a touch of fashion and coziness to your sleeping space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durable Stitching:</strong> Comforter has exquisite stitching to prevent filling from shifting or clumping, ensuring lasting comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit Sheets:</strong> Deep-pocket fitted sheet with an elastic band on all four sides accommodates mattresses up to 14 inches thick.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low for convenient maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Deep-pocket fitted sheet up to 14 inches thick</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
